  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 703.03 Termination of Authority.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 381:10, within 10 days after termination of employment of any railroad police officer, the railroad shall file notice of termination at the:\n\nOffice of the Commissioner\n\nDepartment of Safety\n\nJames H. Hayes Building\n\n33 Hazen Drive\n\nConcord, New Hampshire 03305.\n\n(b) Notices of termination filed with the commissioner shall include:\n\n(1) The name of the former officer;\n\n(2) The date of termination;\n\n(3) The name of the railroad; and\n\n(4) The signature and name of the chief police officer.\n\nSource. #2281, eff 1-16-83; ss by #2790, eff 8-2-84; ss by #5067, eff 2-21-91; ss by #6456, INTERIM, eff 2-21-97, EXPIRED: 6-21-97; ss by #6473, eff 3-25-97, EXPIRED: 3-25-05\n\nNew. #8776, eff 12-23-06; ss by #10889, eff 7-16-15",
